Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=26}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:52.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Try to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You need a little fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:58.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want a pillow or maybe some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:00.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I make a great banana pudding. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot, we don't want\Nhim to choke to death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:09.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on any of your culinary disasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:10.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Better that, than the trots he'd get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from choking down one of\Nyour raunchy meat pies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The reason I won't feed him one of my\Nmeat pies, is because after one bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he'd think he'd died\Nand gone to heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't die yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, that was just luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is gonna get up and\Nkick his ass any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:32.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not your funeral,\Nyet, is it? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because one of us has gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And since I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.07,0:02:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd really like to pay my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's taken another fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone hit him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because their usually dead\Nbefore they get close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:19.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fact is... He might\Nnot actually be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kid's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:32.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! End it once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:38.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That punk is fighting with Don Krieg\Nas if he were the same strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:41.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be real. It's like\NI'm watching my own nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be truly invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he gets beaten by this little kid,\Nhis reputation will be completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up, maggots! Never doubt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finally, he's gonna stop\Nmessing around and step up his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Mighty Battle Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that? An exploding spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:13.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gonna try to hide from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right then, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:16.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:17.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Mighty Battle Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:20.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's different from the one\NI was fighting with earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When this thing hits you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:29.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}you won't just be wounded and flailing,\Nyou will be blown straight into Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not a normal spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa,\Nwhoa, not in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That spear really sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It explodes every time\Nhe hits anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My knees...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's lost way too much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:50.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't fight for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This better end quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:56.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You look tired, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess you should've saved\Na little more energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:04:59.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:05.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With everything rocking,\NI can't hit him with full force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've never in my life seen a more stunning\Nweapon than The Mighty Battle Spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:12.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg is the only one strong\Nenough to handle the spear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,since the harder he strikes with it,\Nthe bigger the explosion it causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:19.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Anyone else would just be completely\Ndestroyed by their own pathetic attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:27.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His strength is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He causes the kind of\Ndamage no one else can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:33.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'cause there's just no one\Nelse who can swing a spear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that easily weighs more than a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's exactly why Don Krieg\Nis the most dangerous man in the East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:53.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore boy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Phew... that was really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just like a little bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:18.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. I'm not finished with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:42.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't made me so angry,\NI would have killed you more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:47.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way that Chore Boy\Ncan take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That spear is way too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even with a hundred\Nthousand more weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}our Chore boy can still bring him to his\Nknees, because he does not know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. That was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:28.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:39.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand or fall... Life or death...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In a struggle for your very existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:45.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you cannot have even the slightest\Nbit of fear, or you will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:48.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That kid out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he's fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:07.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid of anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:10.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it just instinct, or all a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:30.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll know soon, if he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What plan? Killing himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:52.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:55.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Do it again!\N– Kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you, today is your funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt that Krieg\Nand his pirates are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:26.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Chore Boy has something\Nthey'll never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:36.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Krieg may have more pirates\Nat his command than anyone else before him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}he may have terrible weapons that cause\Nmass destruction to everything in his path,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:47.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but he will never\Nhave that kid's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Battle Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:12.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just punched it in\Nthe head five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.26,0:10:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks tired, maybe it needs a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:20.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that your little toy's\Nbroken, you're nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:29.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without the blade, it's just a bomb\Non a stick and let's face it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that's pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:42.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Fine, so what if\Nit is just a bomb on a stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're in sad shape, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be more than\Nenough to blow you to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:51.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Ya know, it sounds to me like this is\Nsome sort of pathetic attempt at a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy's pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He might be able to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He just shattered the\NMighty Battle Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he's still alive\Nafter that many explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your defeat is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:22.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, when you defied me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:25.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You signed your own death warrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:35.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bounce outta that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many weapons does that guy have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:08.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What exactly did you\Nexpect to happen, Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing Wootz Steel Body Armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This stuff is practically\Nindestructible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:34.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:13:00.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's useless. You'll never defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:03.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This armor could take a million\Nmore of your monkey punches
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it wouldn't have so much as a dent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:10.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.07,0:13:17.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance, Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Real power comes from deadly weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're the source of true strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, only the strong are meant to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:39.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. It's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:47.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Foolish pride will only get you so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:05.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all that big talk,\Nthat's all you've got? Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.04,0:14:13.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it,\Nmy armor's cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:18.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:21.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're done for, chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a trap! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:58.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:01.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it just instinct, or all a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll know soon, if he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:11.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.93,0:15:14.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}... Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– All right!\N– Way to go chore boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I totally win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet, Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:06.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a steel net!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over! That's the ocean\Ndown there below us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like I'll be getting\Nthe last laugh after all, Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take him down Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make that little brat pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, I got that jerk\Nright where I want him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:45.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He hasn't even flinched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How can he stay so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:52.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time for me\Nto end this, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:13.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}... Giant Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg was defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How could this have happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're awesome, Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you kicked his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won! He really won!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:51.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:52.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta be dreamin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's Don Krieg we're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.64,0:17:57.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know! Who'd a thought\Nthat kid had it in 'im?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Krieg was beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:06.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Betcha you never thought\Nyou'd see the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:07.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you done daydreaming, yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on, save that kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:28.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:33.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those with the power\Nof the devil fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are hated by the sea, so they\Nlose their ability to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:38.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you sayin'? He'll just sink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.97,0:18:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You could've told me that sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you worthless old geezer!\NWhat if it's already too late?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:22.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You truly believe that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:28.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll have\Nto do better than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:31.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,... if you want to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:37.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Because, I don't think it's\Ntime for me to die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:39.03,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:48.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.34,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How this fight would\Nend was clear from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.96,FlashbackThoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why choose death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:57.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! Give up\Nyour ambition and live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:08.15,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:24.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know...\Nbut, I will not run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:30.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if I retreat a single step, I would\Nbe shattering the promises I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:31.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:33.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I would lose my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:38.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, without that, there would\Nbe nothing left for me, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:41.39,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Even with a hundred\Nthousand more weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:46.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}our chore boy can still bring him to his\Nknees, because he does not know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:51.35,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Krieg may have more pirates at his\Ncommand, he may have terrible weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that cause mass destruction\Nto everything in his path,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:05.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chore Boy,\Ndon't you die on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:08.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:11.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us it's an act!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:18.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the mighty rule of the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:20.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, now\Nhe's down for the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have a look at him\Nand see for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.39,0:21:24.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That fancy armor\Nof his got all busted up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:27.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he was out as soon\Nas he hit the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Do you think we're lying to ya'?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was the only man\NI ever really admired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:37.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How foolish, now he's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you move now, the poison'll set in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:51.16,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Be still!\NIt's for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:22:00.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still have a lot of\Nthings to do with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:12.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You really are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:17.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! I'm the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I win! I'm the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:21.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one defeats me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.41,0:22:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Just stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop him! He's not even conscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:33.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please Don, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to win! I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:48.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:50.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:56.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll fight until victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.20,0:23:08.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's leave now, while we\Nstill have a shred of dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure, now leave\Nand don't ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.38,0:23:28.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't owe me any favors,\Nbut when the kid wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell him I said I'll\Nsee him on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where I wanna go\Nwith the time I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.77,0:23:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:43.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing that keeps me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.11,0:23:45.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. It would seem that\NDon Krieg's obsession
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.95,0:23:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with the Grand Line, has\Nbecome mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:55.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:57.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:23:59.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, it's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:04.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With this poison in my veins,\NI may only have a few hours to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.26,0:24:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, I feel free somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.93,0:24:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,like now I can live those last\Nfew moments on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.27,0:24:20.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}To hell with loyalty to Don Krieg.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.73,0:24:25.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}My devotion to him was just an escape\Nfrom forging my own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.86,0:24:30.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once you heart is set,\Nand you pursue all your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.07,0:24:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with every last fiber of what you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.58,0:24:35.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you will never again feel lost,\Nor hopeless, or afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.58,0:24:38.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I learned all that from\Na brave chore boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.09,0:24:44.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.59,0:24:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give him the boat we use\Nto go grocery shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.80,0:24:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Are you stupid or somethin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.22,0:24:52.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to give a perfectly\Ngood boat to a bunch of pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:56.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what's gonna happen to all\Nour grocery shopping, Jackass?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty's right. Let 'em swim\Nwherever they're goin' to!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go get that grocery boat, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.57,0:25:07.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.19,0:25:09.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.32,0:25:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay,\Nokay, we'll go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:23.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gonna sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.18,0:25:37.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did I hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.72,0:25:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was I so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:43.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I think about it,\NI can't help but feel stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.15,0:25:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.70,0:25:55.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:25:59.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.08,0:26:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gratefully accept this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.66,0:26:03.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I right to assume there's\Nno need to return it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.75,0:26:05.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ever come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.59,0:26:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even to return this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.34,0:26:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.76,0:26:15.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't you ever forget, this is\Nthe restaurant where the cooks fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.18,0:26:16.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Baratie!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.01,0:26:19.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. The cooks\Nthere sure mean business.
Comment: 0,0:00:01.19,0:00:01.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=27}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=28}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
